he ones that were shot out later, I'd say around thirty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_09_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_09_s_21","text":"... That's a lot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_09_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_09_s_22","text":"Yeah, but we shot down a lot too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_09_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_09_s_23","text":"And they're still getting slowed down from Whaley and the other Mother Whales shooting out their shockwaves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_09_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_09_s_24","text":"The problem is that they're about to hit their limits.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_09_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_09_s_25","text":"That's okay! As every hero knows, limits can be easily broken!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_09_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_09_s_26","text":"For the first time in a while, you're making sense!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id"